  "description": "PIBPIC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C124 H92 Dy4 N12 O16 S6. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.573-3.826 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.45-110.72°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C124H92Dy4N12O16S6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
